zhu-a-o050-judgment","label":"《吴主传》正文","text":"魏册书以钦命勖相作结。","evidence":["wuzhu-q-o050-judgment"]},{"id":"chengguo-a-68ede530cb4da87927c3","label":"裴注·《傅子》","text":"曹丕受吴降拜孙权为吴王","evidence":["chengguo-q-9dcf9e65ddb8ef841f92"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-017b096d4fd06ef2e1fa","label":"正文","text":"魏使邢贞拜权吴王盛忿愤盟耻","evidence":["chenghuang-q-e18f917d554e5c87c184"]},{"id":"chenghuang-a-4cdc248a33fcadc9fb7c","label":"正文","text":"盛涕泣贞闻之谓江东将相非久下人","evidence":["chenghuang-q-b1bbb00bb7c6e73329d6"]},{"id":"zhanggu-a-47893a5262462e92f59f","label":"正文","text":"邢贞不下车昭责之贞遽下车","evidence":["zhanggu-q-e878294a84c0f64341e0"]},{"id":"shiyi-a-13729691432f95b85782","label":"正文","text":"魏拜孙权为吴王","evidence":["shiyi-q-9714004db8375492106e"]},{"id":"wufan-a-d0969157895a6d0115e0","label":"正文","text":"孙权立为吴王","evidence":["wufan-q-3e759ce5b16277af6c9b"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wendi-p0017","role":"奉使","evidence":["wendi-e-o024b-q"]},{"person":"sun-quan","role":"受封","evidence":["wendi-e-o024b-q"]},{"person":"wudi-p0170","role":"册封","evidence":["wuzhu-e-o048a-q"]},{"person":"wuzhu-p0030","role":"忿愤与同列言君与邢贞盟之辱；因涕泣横流","evidence":["chenghuang-q-e18f917d554e5c87c184","chenghuang-q-b1bbb00bb7c6e73329d6"]},{"person":"wendi-p0133","role":"因邢贞骄色而怒","evidence":["chenghuang-q-e18f917d554e5c87c184"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"黄初二年八月丁巳","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"wendi-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"wendi-q-o019","basis":"黄初二年八月丁巳"},"evidence":["wendi-e-o024b-q","wendi-q-o019","wendi-q-b-ec88012a7f6c352d0e04"]},"ordering_evidence":"wendi-e-o024b-q","source_order":[2,266,"O024b"],"order":584},{"id":"chengguo-e-o186b","title":"程昱与邢贞争威仪见免","accounts":[{"id":"chengguo-a-caa6221e34eb9ef44170","label":"正文","text":"程昱与邢贞争威仪见免","evidence":["chengguo-q-7de338880439512b1873"]}],"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0101","role":"争威仪见免","evidence":["chengguo-q-7de338880439512b1873"]},{"person":"wendi-p0017","role":"与昱争威仪","evidence":["chengguo-q-7de3388804395